[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 26948.99, "timestamp": "07:29:08", "text": "現在可以用了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26955.788, "timestamp": "07:29:15", "text": "不，我現在不想用它。  雅克，你見過我嗎？我有一張。  還有一個人正在走"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26980.628, "timestamp": "07:29:40", "text": "明白了。我們揍他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26983.19, "timestamp": "07:29:43", "text": "一頓。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26987.99, "timestamp": "07:29:47", "text": "呃，他在哪裡？是的。他在哪兒？直走。  不。"}]